# Bounded visual route to the pre-race machine settings screen. Hold the screen
# long enough for a windowed screenshot, then exit without starting a race.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 120
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 10 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 30
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 8 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS A 3
WAIT 90
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 9 3600
LOG machine_settings_visual_hold
WAIT 900
QUIT
